cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software

title: "Software accompanying Formally Verified Neurosymbolic Trajectory Learning via Tensor-based Linear Temporal Logic on Finite Traces"

message: "If you use this software, please cite this release."

abstract: >-
  This software provides an implementation of the methods described in our JAIR paper. It includes formally verified components developed using Isabelle/HOL, generated executable code, and Jupyter notebooks demonstrating the implementation and its applications.

